sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant I as Inventory
    participant B as Billing
    participant N as Notifications
    O->>O: Receive order
    par Reserve stock
        O->>I: Reserve items
        I-->>O: Reserved
    and Charge card
        O->>B: Charge customer
        B-->>O: Charged
    and Notify
        O-)N: Send "order placed" email
    end
    critical Commit order
        O->>I: Commit reservation
    option Commit failed
        O->>B: Refund
    end
